AGENTS.md:157)\n```\n\nThree questions about what counts as done:\n\n1. **Where does the percent reach full colour?** The task says the ramp runs from 60% to full accent at 100%. Your example puts 92% at full accent. On a 60→100 ramp, 92% is only 80% of the way. Should it reach full at 100%, or at about 90% and hold there?\n\n2. **What happens to 50–59%?** Today anything at 50% or above reads in the strong foreground colour, and under 50% reads faint. If the ramp starts at 60 and 42% is faint, 50–59% drops from strong to faint. Is that what you want, with everything under 60% one flat faint?\n\n3. **Does the under side ramp the same?** On baseball, an UNDER quote's column reads STAYED UNDER and shows the complement (an 80% over rate shows 20%). Should a 78% STAYED UNDER get the same warmth as a 78% CLEARED? Football and NBA show only the over side.\n\nI'll stop here until you correct or answer these."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1617,"cache_read_input_tokens":79290,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1617},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d927ec62-fc1a-4016-9073-c3b01d3098bc","uuid":"bc536b9a-f957-4137-b53e-3abf69f9f020","timestamp":"2026-11-04T04:59:14.239Z","request_id":"req_011CghJBvQDBQDhSbKCBJGdT"}
